//- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//- Pug: About
//- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

extends layout

block content
  .container

    div.content

      div.is-flex.is-flex-direction-column.is-align-items-center
        h1.title About me
        figure.image.is-128x128.mt-4
          img(src="/images/profile.jpg", width="128", title="Profile picture").is-rounded
          div.mt-2(style="text-align: center; display: none;") Joseph Trumbull
        p.p-3 #{summary}
      
      div.container.p-5.mt-6
        h2.title.mb-3 The team
        hr

        div.is-flex.is-flex-direction-row.is-align-items-center
          div.mr-4
            figure.image.is-128x128
              img(src="/images/jess.jpg" width="128").is-rounded
          div
            h1.title Jess Davis
            p
              | The most amazing and supportive person in my life. 
              | Her unwavering encouragement and understanding have been my rock through both triumphs and challenges. 
              | She inspires me with her kindness, intelligence, and vibrant spirit. 
              | I'm incredibly grateful for the love and support she brings every day, and I couldn't imagine my world without her.
        
        div.is-flex.is-flex-direction-row.is-align-items-center.mt-5
          div.mr-4
            figure.image.is-128x128
              img(src="/images/ollie.jpg" width="128").is-rounded
          div
            h1.title Ollie
            p
              | Ollie is a loyal and loving companion who brings boundless joy to my life. 
              | Though small in size, his heart and spirit are enormous. 
              | With his playful antics and unwavering affection, he has a way of turning ordinary moments into treasured memories. 
              | Ollie’s presence just makes everything better. 
              | He’s more than just a pet; he’s family, and I cherish every moment we share together.
